    "description": "Fernwood Yoga & Bodywork opened on SE Division Street in 2016. Meet founder Hana Moreau, our teachers and the story of the studio.",
    "image": "https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1767605523281-8b54b3692078?w=1200&q=80"
